Package: greylog
Version: 0.1.3-1
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11)
Maintainer: GreyNOC <Customerservice@greynoc.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/GreyNOC/GreyLog
Description: Local-first log monitoring CLI and analyst dashboard
 GreyLog tails local log files or receives JSON events, stores normalized
 events in SQLite, evaluates alert rules, and serves a loopback-only live
 analyst dashboard.
